    "name": "Maritime Pack (SkizzyNaval NRE-fix build)",
    "abstract": "Fengist's Maritime Pack with its plugins rebuilt to stop the NullReferenceExceptions seen in KSP 1.12 and BDArmory fights.",
    "description": "MPUtils, MPHover, MPEngineSounds and FengistAnim rebuilt from source with null guards for destroyed or split vessels, own-vessel instead of active-vessel lookups, cached hover lists and NaN guards. A ModuleManager patch fixes a missing sound and the misspelt MaxDepth key. All class names and fields are unchanged, so craft and saves load as before. The Maritime Pack is not on CKAN; this build is made from the GitHub snapshot 2822417. Original by Fengist (DataInterlock), CC BY-NC 4.0, non-commercial use only. Bundled FSResizer.dll (Fengist's renamed resizer, needed by the hull parts) is shipped unchanged.",
